        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Key decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Auth (User + /api/auth/login) lives in asset-service; both services verify with shared JWT_SECRET&lt;br&gt;• Cross-database links (Maintenance.assetId → Asset) are advisory; enforce integrity in the service layer&lt;br&gt;• Mongoose partial unique index guarantees one active allocation per asset" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=20;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=11;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
